msgid ""
"5-5.5VDC from USB (internal circuitry and RX only) or via 2 x PowerModule "
"connectors, or via internal BEC off VBAT input pin. All 5V pins are powered "
"when USB, or Power Module(s), or VBAT input is used."
msgstr ""
"通过 USB 供电 5-5.5VDC（仅内部电路和 RX），或通过 2 个电源模块接口，或通过 VBAT 输入引脚上的内部 BEC。使用 "
"USB、电源模块或 VBAT 输入时，所有 5V 引脚均有电。"

