msgid ""
"Internal 5V, 1.5A BEC directly can be used with up to 6S LIPO batteries to "
"supply board and peripheral power up to 1.5A max with voltage only "
"monitoring via BATT2 monitor (500ma max recommended)."
msgstr ""
"内部 5V、1.5A BEC 可直接用于最高 6S LiPo 电池，为飞控板和外设供电（最高 1.5A），仅通过 BATT2 "
"监控器进行电压监控（建议最高 500mA）。"

